            "pages": {
              "end": 45,
              "start": 45
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. KNEEDLER, petitioners further state that the subsidies are merely market\u2011participation subsidies, not services rendered to the government."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
